{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Lightyears of Fervent Warfare?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightyears of Fervent Warfare (LoFW) is a passion project that could primarily be considered a cross between an ARPG and a vertical shoot-em-up, so I like to call it a mash-shmup. I also love many other genres, and some of their DNA will be found in LoFW. Being a passion project means that the game will be constantly developed (it's very therapeutic!), so expect changes and improvements according to feedback from the community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LoFW's Feature Set</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some features, with more to come (I'm open to suggestions!):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable and upgradeable skills that pack a punch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet ricochets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grungy player ship armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy ship armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated levels</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916360?t=1757777813","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916360/b6ad7120047954d2b4b9819f2bf68766d9dc69b3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757777813","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916360/ba2bdf981d345b7dcd653ff92db994f1fa8119fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757777813","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916360/ba2bdf981d345b7dcd653ff92db994f1fa8119fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757777813","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Lightyears of Fervent Warfare?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightyears of Fervent Warfare (LoFW) is a passion project that could primarily be considered a cross between an ARPG and a vertical shoot-em-up, so I like to call it a mash-shmup. I also love many other genres, and some of their DNA will be found in LoFW. Being a passion project means that the game will be constantly developed (it's very therapeutic!), so expect changes and improvements according to feedback from the community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LoFW's Feature Set</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some features, with more to come (I'm open to suggestions!):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable and upgradeable skills that pack a punch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet ricochets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grungy player ship armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy ship armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated levels</p></li></ul>","developers":["Lea Creative Industries"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916360/aef598eeabaeb3dffc4d5b245560c10240a48444/header.jpg?t=1757777813","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257184735,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184735/movie480.mp4?t=1757777812","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184735/movie_max.mp4?t=1757777812"},"name":"Early Gameplay Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257184735/662f19d04a01c35c085858a521cdf65133b430c3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757777812","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184735/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757777812","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257